# xiaokangxxs-miniprogram-scout
# Copy to .env only for local runtimes that support environment variables.
# NEVER commit .env or real credentials.

# Product Hunt official API mode.
# Create/provide your own token and keep it in the host Agent secret store when possible.
PRODUCTHUNT_TOKEN=your_producthunt_token_here

# Optional: raises GitHub API/search limits for repeated or larger scans.
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here

# Optional providers such as Reddit/G2 are intentionally not represented
# with fake generic credentials here. Configure them through the official
# connector/API method supported by your Agent runtime.
